{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1096","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Substring Removal"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ consisting only of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A substring of a string is a contiguous subsequence of that string. So, string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"forces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is substring of string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", but string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"coder"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the number of ways to remove "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one substring from this string in such a way that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" remaining characters are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"equal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (the number of distinct characters either zero or one)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" different characters in $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"can"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" remove the whole string and it is correct. Also note that you should "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"remove at least one character"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since the answer can be rather large (not very large though) print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you are Python programmer, consider using PyPy instead of Python when you submit your code."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains the string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ consisting only of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" different characters in $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the number of ways modulo $$$998244353$$$ to remove "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one substring from $$$s$$$ in such way that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" remaining characters are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"equal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\nabaa\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\naacdeee\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\naz\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$s[l; r]$$$ be the substring of $$$s$$$ from the position $$$l$$$ to the position $$$r$$$ inclusive."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then in the first example you can remove the following substrings: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":fals